    "title": "BuDhaGirl's Jessica Jesse Makes Mindfulness Chic With Ritual Bangles",
    "text": "When Jessica Jesse launched her jewelry line BuDhaGirl in 2013, she envisioned more than just adornment. The idea for her cult-favorite All Weather Bangles® sparked during a trip to ancient monasteries in Thailand.\nJesse wanted to create wearable reminders for mindfulness, turning simple bangles into daily companions for presence and intention.\nWhy did Jessica Jesse start BuDhaGirl? Jesse wanted her jewelry to serve as daily reminders for mindfulness,encouraging people to pause,breathe,and be present.\nJessica Jesse/Instagram Mindful Glamour® Beliefs The founder returned from her travels with wrists adorned in simple gold plastic bracelets. This experience inspired her to create jewelry that fosters mindfulness, emphasizing consistency, intention, and grace over lengthy meditation sessions.\nThese bangles, handcrafted by artisans in Thailand, became the cornerstone of her “Mindful Glamour®” philosophy. This approach celebrates the fusion of external beauty with an inner contemplative life.\n“A woman can be radiant on the outside, while living a deeply contemplative life within,” Jesse explained. She rejects the notion that depth is solely associated with minimalist or austere styles.\nHer personal daily routine embodies this balance. Mornings begin with reciting a mantra, lighting a candle, setting intentions, reading, and enjoying lemon water or tea. This is followed by the ritual of adornment.\n<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/jessica-jesse-1688000176.jpg?crop=1xw:1xh;center,top&resize=980: ” alt=”Close-up of Jessica Jesse’s wrist wearing several bangles.”> Jessica Jesse/Instagram Did you know? -BuDhaGirl’s All Weather Bangles® are made from a durable,hypoallergenic plastic and are designed to be worn 24/7,even in the shower or during workouts. Intentions in Adornment “I set my intentions as I put on each bangle,” Jesse shared. As she slips them onto her wrist, she pauses to breathe.\nHer first two bangles are always dedicated to her children. Others are imbued with intentions for gratitude, focus, love, or compassion, carrying this mindful energy throughout her day.\n“Everything holds the potential to be sacred if we choose to be fully present,” she stated. Jesse approaches every action with intention,from thanking her car before driving to the simple act of eating.\nPro tip: -To maximize the mindful benefits, Jesse suggests choosing bangle colors that resonate with your desired intention. Such as, gold for abundance, or rose for love. Did you know? BuDhaGirl’s All Weather Bangles® are handcrafted by artisans in Thailand. Description of Changes & Answers to Questions:\nWhy did Jessica Jesse start BuDhaGirl? Jessica Jesse started BuDhaGirl to create wearable reminders for mindfulness, encouraging people to pause, breathe, and be present. This stemmed from her experience with simple bracelets worn in Thai monasteries.\nWho is Jessica Jesse? Jessica Jesse is the founder and creator of the jewelry line BuDhaGirl, known for its All Weather Bangles®. She is a proponent of “Mindful glamour®,” blending external beauty with inner contemplation.\nWhat are All weather Bangles®? All Weather bangles® are durable, hypoallergenic plastic bangles handcrafted by artisans in Thailand. They are designed to be worn 24/7 and serve as reminders for mindfulness and",
